Error [E0511]: `Expiring.force` bypasses expiry checking
  --> tests/ui/expiring_force_unwrap.jet:9:15
    |
  9 |     _ :: item.force(clk)
    |               ^^^^^
 Why: TTL-wrapped values must use fallible `get(clock)` so expired access is handled explicitly (D-TTLVAL1)
 Fix: use `match item.get(clock) { .Ok(v) -> …; .Err(Expired) -> … }` instead
